  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-privacy-mode",
      "title": {
        "en": "Privacy Mode",
        "zh": "隐私模式"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Two asymmetric visibility modes. In NORMAL, the plugins you mark private are not composed at all — no row, no tools, no prompt text — and their workspaces and chats are archived. PRIVATE composes the whole profile again behind a password or a platform authenticator, with a per-chat privacy button, a grouped workspace list and bulk classification.",
        "zh": "两个方向不对称的可见性模式。常规模式下，被标记为隐私的插件根本不参与组合（没有行、没有工具、没有提示词），其工作区与对话被归档；隐私模式整份 profile 重新装载，用密码或系统指纹进入，并提供单对话隐私开关、分组工作区与批量分类。"
      },
